<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millennium cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millennium cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said Wednesday analyst Andy Cash downgraded Millennium Chemicals Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 3/4 at 20-5/8.</p>
</text>
